<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <base href="/" />
    <title>DashSpec</title>
    @* ADR-0112 render stacks: the host links nothing itself — stacks and
       plugins mount their own assets. There is no "own css" of anyone — a
       stack IS the visual language of the surface. SelfMade mounts its head
       links and scripts; Radzen reads the theme token and links its own
       reading (RadzenStackHead); plugins mount their vertical css/js
       (ADR-0059/0060). The Radzen-theme-last position is the transitional
       mixed-chrome state (ADR-0112 §4). *@
    <SelfMadeStackHead />
    <FilterBuiltinsHead />
    <VizBuiltinsHead />
    <RadzenVizHead />
    <RadzenStackHead Theme="dark" />
    <HeadOutlet />
</head>

<body>
    <Routes />
    <SelfMadeStackScripts />
    <VizBuiltinsScripts />
    <RadzenStackScripts />
    <script src="/js/aiguiders-input.js?v=4"></script>
    <script src="js/dashspec-download.js?v=2"></script>
    <script src="_framework/blazor.web.js"></script>
</body>

</html>
